{{Documentation}}
This template is used to display the material drop rates in a [[Legend Stages]] sub-chapter alongside [[Template:MaterialDrops]]. Data comes from DropItem.csv.

==Usage==
<pre>
{{MaterialRates|none|bricks|feathers|coal|sprockets|gold|meteorite|beast bones|ammonite|brick z|feathers z|coal z|sprockets z|gold z|meteorite z|beast bones z|ammonite z|noheading=|hidenormal=}}
</pre>
<code>noheading=</code> is added to remove the heading that is attached to the template by default. <code>hidenormal=</code> is added to hide the rows for the normal materials.

==Example Usage==
<tabber>Normal Materials=
<pre>
{{MaterialRates|33|13|13|13|0|13|0|0|13|noheading=}}
</pre>

===Result===
{{MaterialRates|33|13|13|13|0|13|0|0|13|noheading=}}

|-|With Extra-Dimensional Materials=
<pre>
{{MaterialRates|33|0|0|0|0|0|0|0|0|10|10|10|10|10|10|10|0|noheading=}}
</pre>

===Result===
{{MaterialRates|33|0|0|0|0|0|0|0|0|10|10|10|10|10|10|10|0|noheading=}}

|-|Without Normal Materials=
<pre>
{{MaterialRates|33|0|0|0|0|0|0|0|0|10|10|10|10|10|10|10|0|noheading=|hidenormal=}}
</pre>

===Result===
{{MaterialRates|33|0|0|0|0|0|0|0|0|10|10|10|10|10|10|10|0|noheading=|hidenormal=}}
</tabber>

